While playing around with my ring of polymorph, and ring of polymorph
control, I turned into a Mind Flayer.  Its a nice monster, decent hit
points, auto levitating like a vampire lord, and gets a lot of extra
attacks attempting to eat brains.  Unfortunatly the brain eating doesn't
work on mindless creatures like zombies, molds, golems, etc.  The Mind
Flayer can wear all the same equipment as the player.  My question
is about the special ability.  It says do am #monster for a mental blast.
But, nothing special seems to happen when I do this.  I get a message
about concentrating, more rarely a message about a psychic wave pouring
out, and even more rarely it says I "lock in" on some monster.  I check
the monsters with a stethascope, and nothing seems different.  Anyone
know what it does?
